  "description": "The native payload for Agora's AV1 video encoder extension (full-video-av1-codec-enc 4.6.3 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. AV1 encoding, for the bandwidth saving over H.264 where both ends support it. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.SetVideoEncoderConfiguration with an AV1 codec type in the RTC binding.",
